<title>USA: KCS Energy growth seen hampered by verdict.</title>
<headline>KCS Energy growth seen hampered by verdict.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Texas jury verdict against KCS Energy Inc will hurt the New Jersey-based company's acquisition-driven growth strategy, analysts said Monday.</p>
<p>A jury, in a civil trial, awarded Tenneco Inc $143.2 million, in a case concerning KCS's alleged enrichment of natural gas sold to Tenneco, the company said.</p>
<p>In its announcement of the verdict, KCS said the verdict would delay its previously-announced stock offer and acquisition of MidAmerican Energy Co's oil and natural gas operations.</p>
</text>
